VALUES=[('Integrity & Trust','Honest communication, transparency and doing what is right for our clients.'),('Professionalism','High standards in every interaction, service and transaction.'),('Client Commitment','Your needs, goals and satisfaction are at the heart of what we do.'),('Market Knowledge','Constant market study so you can make informed decisions.'),('Excellence','Quality service and attention to detail at every stage.'),('Growth & Innovation','Embracing new opportunities and modern ways of working.')]
